ChessEngine Lab
Project code: GPL-3.0-or-later. See LICENSE.

python-chess / chess: https://github.com/niklasf/python-chess (GPL-3.0-or-later).
Stockfish: https://github.com/official-stockfish/Stockfish (GPLv3); used for labeling
and explicitly named reference assessments. The production API image installs
the pinned upstream release with its source, license and authors retained; see
scripts/install_stockfish.py. It never substitutes for the demo models.
Lichess database: https://database.lichess.org/ (CC0); game data and generated labels have recorded provenance.
PyTorch: https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch (BSD-style).
NumPy: https://numpy.org/ (BSD-3-Clause).
FastAPI, React, Vite, chess.js, Lucide: see their respective package licenses.
Fonts: DM Sans and Manrope via Google Fonts (SIL Open Font License).

The web chess pieces use local Unicode glyphs, not scraped proprietary artwork.

Elite human-move CNN: independent implementation of the method in Skripkon/chess-engine,
https://github.com/Skripkon/chess-engine/tree/97238ead1892adca5e8626c568cd8129d5993ee9/engines/torch.
Reference method credited; no reference weights or serialized move dictionary imported.
Elite human-game data: https://database.nikonoel.fr/ ; source receipts and study
provenance are described in docs/elite-policy.md.
